cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or software, please cite it as below."
title: "Hindsight: an open benchmark for agent memory over meeting notes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lakhani
    given-names: Kian
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark and harness comparing agent memory systems over Granola-style
  meeting notes for accuracy, cost and latency. Includes Northwind, a synthetic
  184-meeting, 296-question benchmark with verified, line-cited answers, and
  Concentrate, a cited, time-aware meeting memory. Independent research prototype,
  not affiliated with Granola.
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - benchmark
  - meeting transcripts
  - retrieval
  - temporal knowledge
